  "bodyHash": "d0899123a50e6b6d",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b968129e-e5f2-496f-aef9-5750d3d2c959.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>大家好，欢迎来到 <span style=\"color:#0db900\">Necro-Rooted！</span></h3>\n<p>“Necro-Rooted”是我用 Java 代码制作的第一款模组，该模组引入了令人恐惧的寄生虫，旨在毁灭一切生命。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em style=\"color:#0db900\">感染系统与感染起源&nbsp; </em><span style=\"color:#0db900\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0db900\">感染只能通过一种方式开始，那就是.............................腐根之花（Necro-Blossoms）的出现！腐根之花是完全由根系构成的生物，具体来说是一种被称为“腐根”（Necro-Root）的根，它们是这些<span style=\"color:#ed070b\">可憎之物（Abominations），<span style=\"color:#0db900\">腐-</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0db900\">根之花会像原版怪物一样在黑暗区域生成，它们会从地</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><span style=\"color:#ed070b\"><span style=\"color:#0db900\">面钻出，随后会静止几秒。接着它们会绽放，召唤出本模组的主要传播者——腐根孢子（Necro-Spore）。这种孢子拥有意识并能思考，它会飞起来，当击中目标时，会进入其体内并施加一个名为“生长”（Growing）的效果。如果该效果结束，实体将被感染；如果该实体没有感染变体，它将分裂成两个孢子。</span></span></span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><span style=\"color:#ed070b\">猜</span></span><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><span style=\"color:#ed070b\">到梗了吗？嘿嘿嘿&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><span style=\"color:#ed070b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6ee0454e-aa7e-4fde-ab91-0ec71f80288b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"471\" height=\"789\"></span></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#0db900\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <em>它们的弱点与如何防止被感染</em></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><em>与其他感染类模组不同，它们并不怕火，反而对火焰免疫，但畏水。如果腐根生物接触到水，就会开始死亡。另外，它们在水中会下沉，在岩浆中会漂浮。</em></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><em>为了防止被感染，你需要进入水中，这会移除该效果并拯救该实体。</em></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#308f00\"><em><span style=\"color:#28ae00\">腐根进化与融合系统&nbsp;</span></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#308f00\"><span style=\"color:#28ae00\">当腐根感染者（Necro-Rooted）获得 3 个击杀后，腐根进化计时器将开始倒计时。当计时器归零时，腐根感染者将会进化。在腐根进化计时器运行期间，实体有概率会寻找另一个腐根感染者进行融合，从而创造出腐根受难者（Necro-Befallen）。</span></span><span style=\"color:#308f00\"><span style=\"color:#28ae00\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><em>特别感谢：</em></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><em>Seeker_Dev</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0db900\"><em>Dr. Pilot</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0db900\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f582f7b5-20f7-406c-8d5f-cfcfb017cbf7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"465\"></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>模组 Discord：</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/feM5yyEUkD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1026887/description_12a75552-41cf-4529-8686-92a11e8be41d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"173\">https://discord.gg/SHZYwSv4mp</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</h2>\n<h1>Ko-fi：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/aarokend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/aarokend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">s://k</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/aarokend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">o-fi.com/aarokend</a><img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px\" src=\"https://cdn3d.iconscout.com/3d/premium/thumb/kofi-11382936-9148201.png?f=webp\" alt=\"Kofi 设计素材 - 免费提供 SVG、PNG、BLEND、GIF 格式 | IconScout\" width=\"184\" height=\"184\"></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><em><strong><span style=\"color:#0db900\">模组 Wiki：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fseemly-lint-67c.notion.site%252fNecro-Rooted-Wiki-1c23c6bff2e7809aa45cd0f241ce57da\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://seemly-lint-67c.notion.site/Necro-Rooted-Wiki-1c23c6bff2e7809aa45cd0f241ce57da</a></span></strong></em></h1>\n<p>关于本模组的视频 :D：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1WMPNjKq9mI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VX_X2BtOqy0?t=18s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oazzky0GjE4?t=8s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
